%% showcase: stateDiagram composite bodies on one line
%% prose: Mermaid's lexer opens a composite at `{` and closes it at `}` wherever they fall, so a whole body, nested ones included, can share the line with its braces. Door holds Open and Closed; Lock nests Engaged inside Bolt on a single line.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Door
    state Door { Open --> Closed }
    Door --> Lock : shut
    state Lock { state Bolt { [*] --> Engaged } }
    Lock --> [*]
